    %% YAML → Loaders
    PC_YAML --> PCL
    DQ_YAML --> DQCL
    FILT_YAML --> FCL
    FG_YAML --> FGL
    COMP_YAML --> PCL

    %% Loaders inheritance
    BCL --> PCL
    BCL --> DQCL
    BCL --> FCL

    %% Loaders → Infra Schemas (validation)
    PCL --> PYC
    DQCL --> DQF
    FCL --> FFG

    %% Infra Schemas → Domain Config
    PYC --> PIPE
    DQF --> DQC
    FFG --> SFC & GFC

    %% Domain Config composition
    PIPE --> TC
    PIPE --> DQC
    PIPE --> SFC
    PIPE --> GFC

    %% Application uses domain config
    PIPE --> RPC
    RT --> LC

